1
00:00:00,203 --> 00:00:02,316
Our data comes from interactive portals

2
00:00:02,316 --> 00:00:05,499
like ASAP and GSCM,

3
00:00:05,499 --> 00:00:07,516
where we download ready-made reports.

4
00:00:09,155 --> 00:00:10,933
But downloads alone aren't ready

5
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:13,497
for analysis or scheduled reporting.

6
00:00:13,497 --> 00:00:15,469
We still need to extract the data,

7
00:00:15,469 --> 00:00:17,119
standardize its format,

8
00:00:17,119 --> 00:00:18,820
and load it into a destination.

9
00:00:20,150 --> 00:00:21,295
Meet Metronome.

10
00:00:21,295 --> 00:00:24,414
Build data pipelines in minutes, without code.

11
00:00:24,414 --> 00:00:25,367
Schedule them,

12
00:00:25,367 --> 00:00:27,094
trigger a run when you need it,

13
00:00:27,094 --> 00:00:29,159
and track every run in one place.

14
00:00:31,202 --> 00:00:32,800
Instead of writing a script,

15
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:34,153
build your own Flow.

16
00:00:34,153 --> 00:00:36,222
Choose a website and the report you need.

17
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,824
Choose where the data goes and when it runs.

18
00:00:45,008 --> 00:00:46,993
While the script is still being written,

19
00:00:46,993 --> 00:00:49,311
your Flow is ready. No code needed.

20
00:00:52,202 --> 00:00:55,140
At two AM, local AI agents keep working

21
00:00:55,140 --> 00:00:57,305
across your reports and pipelines,

22
00:00:57,305 --> 00:00:58,761
checking missing data,

23
00:00:58,761 --> 00:01:00,888
refresh issues, and blank rows.

24
00:01:04,203 --> 00:01:06,639
By morning, five issues are flagged.

25
00:01:06,639 --> 00:01:09,685
Open one to see the evidence and a proposed fix.

26
00:01:12,208 --> 00:01:14,334
There are two ways to use Metronome.

27
00:01:14,334 --> 00:01:17,315
Open it in your browser, just like any other website.

28
00:01:19,000 --> 00:01:22,129
Or connect Metronome MCP to your AI,

29
00:01:22,129 --> 00:01:23,867
and create flows with a prompt.

30
00:01:25,202 --> 00:01:26,607
Without that connection,

31
00:01:26,607 --> 00:01:30,125
your AI may take wrong turns, retry steps,

32
00:01:30,125 --> 00:01:32,057
or return the wrong reporting period.

33
00:01:33,703 --> 00:01:35,662
With Metronome MCP,

34
00:01:35,662 --> 00:01:37,376
it can follow the portal workflow,

35
00:01:37,376 --> 00:01:39,572
create your Flow, and check the result.

36
00:01:42,511 --> 00:01:43,761
Fewer retries.

37
00:01:43,761 --> 00:01:45,862
Less time and fewer tokens.

38
00:01:45,862 --> 00:01:48,622
Accurate data, in your own repeatable Flow.
